      "content": "I have cross-referenced the new rotation against the latest regulatory limits in all affected sectors and confirmed that the calculated margins strictly exceed the 10-hour mandatory reset, even accounting for loading/unloading buffers. The data indicates we are operating with a safe compliance buffer of approximately 15 to 20 minutes per shift in the most critical zones. I will add a detailed \"Compliance Verification\" table to the memo before distribution to proactively demonstrate this buffer and neutralize any claims of non-compliance regarding the 10-hour rule.",
